1	EB-1A Criteria Masterclass	Deep-dive into all 10 EB-1A criteria with real case examples and USCIS adjudication patterns. Understand what RFEs look like and how to preempt them.	eb1a	120	criteria	2026-04-17 15:53:09.912606+00
2	Building Your Citation Evidence Package	How to document, present, and contextualize academic citations for maximum impact. Includes Google Scholar strategy and expert letter templates.	eb1a	45	evidence	2026-04-17 15:53:09.912606+00
3	Understanding the Extraordinary Ability Standard	What "extraordinary ability" actually means to USCIS officers. Examines 50 approved and denied petitions to identify patterns.	eb1a	60	strategy	2026-04-17 15:53:09.912606+00
4	EB-2 NIW: The Three-Prong Test Explained	Detailed breakdown of the Dhanasar framework. How to articulate national interest for STEM researchers and entrepreneurs.	niw	90	criteria	2026-04-17 15:53:09.912606+00
5	O-1A for Tech Professionals	Practical guide to O-1A for software engineers, ML researchers, and product leaders. Includes documentation checklist.	o1	75	criteria	2026-04-17 15:53:09.912606+00
6	Writing Compelling Support Letters	Templates, guidance, and real examples of effective support letters from distinguished researchers and industry leaders.	eb1a	50	evidence	2026-04-17 15:53:09.912606+00
